%% Egress proxy flow (planned, Phase 5). Explained in: docs/components/Egress_Proxy.md
flowchart LR
    SB[Sandboxed agent] -->|only route| EP[aegis-egress-proxy*]
    EP --> MODE{mode}
    MODE -->|observe| LOG[log + forward]
    MODE -->|enforce| CHK{allowlisted?}
    MODE -->|lockdown| DENYALL[deny all except control plane]
    CHK -->|yes| NET[destination]
    CHK -->|no| BLK[block]
    LOG & BLK & DENYALL --> EVT[runtime event → SOC]
